#: ../../extend/contract.md:1
msgid "钩子基础契约"
msgstr "Hook basics"

#: ../../extend/contract.md:3
msgid "任何钩子（不管是不是扩展点）都遵循这一套元数据与清单契约。"
msgstr ""
"Every hook (extension point or not) follows this metadata and manifest "
"contract."

#: ../../extend/contract.md:5
msgid "模块元数据"
msgstr "Module metadata"

#: ../../extend/contract.md:15
msgid "`__hookname__`、`__appversion__` 也可选，会原样出现在 `GET /api/v2/hooks` 的元数据里。"
msgstr ""
"`__hookname__` and `__appversion__` are optional too; they appear "
"verbatim in the metadata from `GET /api/v2/hooks`."

#: ../../extend/contract.md:17
msgid ""
"`__catalog__` 决定**扩展类型**，只有五个值有专门契约：`auth`（登录 Provider）、`upload`（存储驱动）、 "
"`processor`（字节流后处理）、`moderator`（内容审核，见[内容审核](moderator.md)）、`mail`（邮件通道）；"
" 其他值或留空都按纯界面钩子处理（清单里的 `kind` 为 `ui`）。 声明的类型与模块实际导出的函数对不上时，`warnings` "
"里会列出缺失的函数名。"
msgstr "`__catalog__` decides the **extension type**; only five values have a "
"dedicated contract: `auth` (login provider), `upload` (storage driver), "
"`processor` (byte-stream post-processing), `moderator` (content "
"moderation, see [content moderation](moderator.md)) and `mail` (mail "
"transport). Any other value, or none at all, is treated as a UI-only hook "
"(manifest `kind` is `ui`). When the declared type does not match the "
"functions the module actually exports, `warnings` lists the missing "
"function names."

