msgstr ""
"Display group; defaults to `__catalog__`. **Usually leave it alone**: the"
" front end uses `catalog === \"upload\"` to detect a storage driver whose"
" credentials belong on the backend page, and overriding it makes the "
"hooks page show a duplicate config form"

