#: ../../extend/contract.md:62
msgid ""
"点号会被换成下划线：插槽 `admin.hook_setting` → `slot_admin_hook_setting`。 "
"函数签名只写需要的参数即可（核心按签名过滤关键字参数），`**kwargs` 会收到全部。"
msgstr ""
"Dots become underscores: the `admin.hook_setting` slot is "
"`slot_admin_hook_setting`. Declare only the parameters you need in the "
"signature (the core filters keyword arguments by signature); `**kwargs` "
"receives everything."

#: ../../extend/contract.md:65
msgid "插槽白名单"
msgstr "Slot allowlist"

#: ../../extend/contract.md:67
msgid ""
"`nav`、`login.after_form`、`profile`、`user.setting`、`admin.site_setting`、 "
"`admin.hook_setting`、`image.detail`、`upload.after`。"
msgstr ""
"`nav`, `login.after_form`, `profile`, `user.setting`, "
"`admin.site_setting`, `admin.hook_setting`, `image.detail`, "
"`upload.after`."

#: ../../extend/contract.md:70
msgid "不在白名单里的插槽会被丢弃。以 `admin.` 开头的插槽、`scope: \"admin\"` 的动作与 数据源接口只对管理员开放。"
msgstr ""
"Slots outside the allowlist are dropped. Slots starting with `admin.`, "
"actions with `scope: \"admin\"` and data-source endpoints are only "
"available to administrators."

#: ../../extend/contract.md:73
msgid "界面节点词表"
msgstr "Interface node vocabulary"

#: ../../extend/contract.md:75
#, python-brace-format
msgid "钩子返回节点树（`{type, ...}` 或它们的列表），前端只有一个递归渲染器， 所有类型与键都在 `libs/ui.py` 里白名单化："
msgstr ""
"A hook returns a node tree (`{type, ...}` or a list of them); the front "
"end has a single recursive renderer and every type and key is allowlisted"
" in `libs/ui.py`:"

#: ../../extend/contract.md:78
msgid ""
"**结构**：`fieldset`、`group`、`row`（`gap`）、`col`（`span`）、`tabs`、`collapse`、 "
"`list`（`empty`）、`list_item`（`title`、`description`、`row_actions`）"
msgstr ""
"**Structure**: `fieldset`, `group`, `row` (`gap`), `col` (`span`), "
"`tabs`, `collapse`, `list` (`empty`), `list_item` (`title`, "
"`description`, `row_actions`)"

#: ../../extend/contract.md:80
msgid ""
"**展示**：`text`（`muted`）、`alert` / "
"`badge`（`level`）、`image`（`src`、`alt`、`fit`）、 `code`、`divider`（`label`）"
msgstr ""
"**Display**: `text` (`muted`), `alert` / `badge` (`level`), `image` "
"(`src`, `alt`, `fit`), `code`, `divider` (`label`)"

#: ../../extend/contract.md:82
msgid ""
"**表单**：`input`、`number`、`password`、`textarea`、`switch`、`select`、`radio` "
"（键与 `config_schema` 基本一致）"
msgstr ""
"**Forms**: `input`, `number`, `password`, `textarea`, `switch`, `select`,"
" `radio` (keys basically match `config_schema`)"

#: ../../extend/contract.md:84
msgid ""
"**交互**：`button`（`action`、`with_form`、`confirm`、`refresh`、`variant`、`size`）、"
" `link`（`href`、`target`）、`dropdown` / `dropdown_item`"
msgstr ""
"**Interaction**: `button` (`action`, `with_form`, `confirm`, `refresh`, "
"`variant`, `size`), `link` (`href`, `target`), `dropdown` / "
"`dropdown_item`"

#: ../../extend/contract.md:87
msgid "约定与限制："
msgstr "Conventions and limits:"

#: ../../extend/contract.md:89
#, python-brace-format
msgid "每个节点都可带 `when: {field, op, value}`，按当前表单值决定是否渲染（`eq` / `ne` 等）。"
msgstr ""
"Every node may carry `when: {field, op, value}` to decide whether it "
"renders from the current form values (`eq` / `ne` and so on)."

#: ../../extend/contract.md:90
#, python-brace-format
msgid "文案里的 `{key}` 会用 `context` 的值替换，用于显示 `{username}` 之类的信息。"
msgstr ""
"`{key}` inside text is replaced with the `context` value, for showing "
"things like `{username}`."

#: ../../extend/contract.md:91
msgid "`href` 只接受站内路径或 `http(s)` 协议，`//evil.com` 会被丢弃。"
msgstr ""
"`href` only accepts in-site paths or the `http(s)` scheme; `//evil.com` "
"is dropped."

#: ../../extend/contract.md:92
msgid "`action` 必须是清单里声明过的名字，否则按钮不生效。"
msgstr ""
"`action` must be a name declared in the manifest, otherwise the button "
"does nothing."

#: ../../extend/contract.md:93
msgid ""
"图标写 `builtin:xxx` 或 `brand:xxx`。前端是一张**固定映射表** "
"（`web/src/components/hook/icons.js`），当前可用的 `builtin` "
"只有：`plug`、`external`、`link`、 "
"`refresh`、`settings`、`upload`、`download`、`copy`、`tool`、`star`、`delete`； "
"`brand:*` 不论叫什么一律显示通用链接图标。 表里没有的 `builtin:xxx` **不报错也不显示**（`<el-icon>` "
"直接不渲染）；不带前缀的名字在清洗阶段 就被丢弃。"
msgstr ""
"Icons are written as `builtin:xxx` or `brand:xxx`. The front end uses a "
"**fixed lookup table** (`web/src/components/hook/icons.js`); the "
"available `builtin` values are only `plug`, `external`, `link`, "
"`refresh`, `settings`, `upload`, `download`, `copy`, `tool`, `star`, "
"`delete`. Any `brand:*` shows the generic link icon regardless of the "
"name. A `builtin:xxx` missing from the table **neither errors nor "
"renders** (`<el-icon>` renders nothing); a name without a prefix is "
"dropped during sanitising."

#: ../../extend/contract.md:99
msgid "单次返回节点数、层级、文本长度都有上限（`MAX_CHILDREN` / `MAX_DEPTH` / `MAX_TEXT`）。"
msgstr ""
"The node count per response, nesting depth and text length are all capped"
" (`MAX_CHILDREN` / `MAX_DEPTH` / `MAX_TEXT`)."

#: ../../extend/contract.md:100
msgid ""
"多语言：节点与 `config_schema` 可带 `text_key` / `label_key` / `placeholder_key` /"
" `help_key`， 由前端词表（`web/src/i18n/zh.js` / `en.js`）翻译，词表没有该键时显示你给的原文。 "
"**不声明这些键的钩子也能被翻译**——前端会按模块名兜底查 `hooks.<模块名>.fields.<字段 "
"key>.label`（`placeholder` / `help` 同理）与 `hooks.<模块名>.title` / "
"`.description`，所以站点可以在词表里为第三方钩子补译文，不必改钩子包。"
msgstr "Localisation: nodes and `config_schema` can carry `text_key` / `label_key` "
"/ `placeholder_key` / `help_key`, translated by the front-end catalogue "
"(`web/src/i18n/zh.js` / `en.js`); when the catalogue has no such key the "
"original text you provide is shown. **Hooks that declare none of these "
"keys can still be translated** — the front end falls back to "
"`hooks.<module>.fields.<field key>.label` by module name (`placeholder` / "
"`help` likewise) plus `hooks.<module>.title` / `.description`, so a site "
"can localise a third-party hook inside the catalogue without touching the "
"package."

