"failure;"

#: ../../extend/contract.md:132
msgid "失败原因写在 `message`（英文），由前端映射成中文；`refresh: true` 让前端刷新当前块；"
msgstr ""
"the failure reason goes into `message` (English) and the front end maps "
"it to Chinese; `refresh: true` makes the front end reload the current "
"block;"

#: ../../extend/contract.md:133
