"驱动 / processor / provider 的返回值同样是 `code: int` + `message`；沿用了老字段 `msg` 的 "
"第三方驱动仍能工作（核心按 `message or msg` 读取），但新代码不要再用，见[存储驱动](storage.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Drivers, processors and providers use the same `code: int` + `message`; a"
" third-party driver that still uses the old `msg` field keeps working "
"(the core reads `message or msg`), but new code must not — see [Storage "
"drivers](storage.md)."

